A note on what this covers, since the project's face and icon are its identity:

*   `crates/`, `apps/`, `scripts/`, `tools/` and `docs/` are MIT, as above.
*   The Hanglock app icon and the wordmark are released into CC0 / public domain
    (see `assets/SOURCES.md`), so a fork carries no legal ambiguity and needs no
    rebrand to build. This is a deliberate difference from projects that reserve
    their artwork; a utility people are meant to extend gains more from a free
    mark than it loses.
*   Nothing in this repository is third-party artwork or a third-party font. The
    digits are our own generated geometry (`hanglock-render/src/face_data.rs`,
    produced by `tools/model/gen_face.py` from `tools/model/hanglock_ref.py`).
